    "description": "Beautiful 3-unit building featuring two spacious 2BD/1BA units and a fully renovated 1BD/1BA garden unit. The top-floor unit is filled with natural light, freshly painted, and offers Bay views. A sunny deck off the kitchen leads to a large, private backyard\u2014perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The second-floor unit mirrors the layout and has its own stairs leading down to the backyard. The garden-level 1BD/1BA unit has been tastefully renovated with modern finishes and enjoys direct access to the backyard, which features fruit trees and a BBQ area. A spacious 2-car garage provides off-street parking and additional storage. Ideal for owner-occupants, investors, or multi-generational living. Located in a quiet residential neighborhood known for its abundant sunshine and excellent weather. Conveniently close to Glen Park, Mission Terrace, and Balboa Park, with easy access to BART, Muni, tech shuttles, and major freeways. A rare combination of flexibility, light, and location! There is a potential for the entire property to be delivered vacant."
